    "cols2_749293504": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "vince.wolff@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "vince.wolff@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 15 2019 17:31:44 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 15 2019 17:31:44 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2",
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "vince.wolff@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "vince.wolff@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 15 2019 17:34:36 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">VariAx 2 Mini Fragment</span></span><br>\n<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Plating System</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Oct 15 2019 17:35:32 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "largeheadline_copy_1": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "jeannie.chan@stryker.com",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "vince.wolff@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 23 2018 11:50:11 GMT-0500",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "line2": "<p>The&nbsp;new VariAx 2 Mini Fragment plating system&nbsp;features a&nbsp;complete range of&nbsp;low profile plate and&nbsp;screw options&nbsp;in 2.0mm, 2.4mm and 2.7mm modules.&nbsp;Plates utilize the SmartLock variable angle locking technology.</p>\r\n<p>Plates&nbsp;featured in this system include a wide variety of&nbsp;types&nbsp;including broad and narrow straight&nbsp;locking&nbsp;plates as well as&nbsp;locking&nbsp;plates in T, Y and Triangle designs.&nbsp;These plates offer both locking and compression capabilities. The system also offers&nbsp;profile plates,&nbsp;which are&nbsp;intended to facilitate fracture reduction due to the&nbsp;extremely&nbsp;low-profile&nbsp;and non-locking design.</p>\r\n<p>The system features a streamlined and simplified instrument and screw platform which includes color coded screws and instrumentation designed to increase procedural efficiency.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Learn more about our full plating portfolio here.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 30 2019 20:01:59 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,1)",
          "textIsRich": [
            "true",
            "true"
          ]
        },
